{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55602","headline":"白马峯 · 延寿","name":"白马峯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖外层峰泻危楼，天际阴阴长寒木。\n南北行人望莫穷，秋云一片横幽谷。\n（见南宋张淏《宝庆续会稽志》卷四「姜山」条。\n《乾隆绍兴府志》卷四、《光绪余姚县志》卷二亦载此五首诗，字句颇有异同。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}